# Build context: an allowlist, not a deny list.
#
# Everything is excluded and the few files the image actually needs are added
# back. Built the other way round, forgetting one pattern would ship `.env`, the
# conversation transcripts in sessions/, or whatever the agent wrote into
# workspace/ into a public image — so the default has to be "not included".

*

!package.json
!pnpm-lock.yaml
!pnpm-workspace.yaml
!tsconfig.json
!src
